s://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/0e/ik5tdjtr4q5h2jonrnz00qgqmsoj8s0.png/120px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E5%87%9B%E8%80%80%E5%89%91%E5%BF%83.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/0/0e/ik5tdjtr4q5h2jonrnz00qgqmsoj8s0.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />凛耀剑心\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:60%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦每回合首次行动后，可[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"再行动\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">再行动</font></span></span>]。无视[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"格挡\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">格挡</font></span></span>]，拥有特定[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值加成•狄奥娜\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">虔诚值加成•狄奥娜</font></span></span>]。<br />✦非[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"瞬发\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">瞬发</font></span></span>]攻击后，若与目标处于直线上，则施加同向[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"剑痕\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">剑痕</font></span></span>]，当[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"剑痕\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">剑痕</font></span></span>]凑成[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"十字锋芒\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">十字锋芒</font></span></span>]时，移除并对目标造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">170%</font>物理伤害。<br />✦触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"十字锋芒\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">十字锋芒</font></span></span>]时，[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]增加<font color=\"#58cb48\">10</font>点，每回合最多触发<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>次。<br />✦攻防属性提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">5%</font>，移动力增加<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>格。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><b>该个性属于</b><br /><br /><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:90px;height:90px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%8B%84%E5%A5%A5%E5%A8%9C\" title=\"角色图鉴库/狄奥娜\"><img alt=\"头像 狄奥娜.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/6/69/3k01hs8h1x90i6tejnl6yrh46nftbx7.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:90px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">狄奥娜</font></div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦每回合首次行动后，可[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"再行动\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">再行动</font></span></span>]。无视[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"格挡\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">格挡</font></span></span>]，拥有特定[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值加成•狄奥娜\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">虔诚值加成•狄奥娜</font></span></span>]。<br />✦非[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"瞬发\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">瞬发</font></span></span>]攻击后，若与目标处于直线上，则施加同向[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"剑痕\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">剑痕</font></span></span>]，当[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"剑痕\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">剑痕</font></span></span>]凑成[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"十字锋芒\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">十字锋芒</font></span></span>]时，移除并对目标造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">170%</font>物理伤害。<br />✦触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"十字锋芒\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">十字锋芒</font></span></span>]时，[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]增加<font color=\"#58cb48\">10</font>点，每回合最多触发<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>次。<br />✦攻防属性提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>，移动力增加<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>格。战斗开始时，[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]增加<font color=\"#58cb48\">10</font>点。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦每回合首次行动后，可[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"再行动\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">再行动</font></span></span>]。无视[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"格挡\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">格挡</font></span></span>]，拥有特定[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值加成•狄奥娜\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">虔诚值加成•狄奥娜</font></span></span>]。<br />✦非[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"瞬发\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">瞬发</font></span></span>]攻击后，若与目标处于直线上，则施加同向[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"剑痕\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">剑痕</font></span></span>]，当[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"剑痕\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">剑痕</font></span></span>]凑成[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"十字锋芒\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">十字锋芒</font></span></span>]时，移除并对目标造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">170%</font>物理伤